 * Entity table: file 0xf5ab0, 73 triples; player table: 0xf5e20, 105 triples.
 * These are observed names, offsets, widths and wire order, not source text.
 * Zero width is binary32; negative width sign-extends the integer on read.
 * The fd_ spelling maps the retail fd. member names to the frozen POD.
 * Intentionally unguarded for table generation and compile-time assertions. */
